{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01609","headline":"杂曲歌辞 出门行二首 一 · 孟郊","name":"杂曲歌辞 出门行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长河悠悠去无极，百龄同此可叹息。\n秋风白露沾人衣，壮心凋落夺颜色。\n少年出门将诉谁，川无梁兮路无岐。\n一闻陌上苦寒奏，使我伫立惊且悲。\n君今得意厌粱肉，岂复念我贫贱时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}